---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Layanan Mandiri Masyarakat - Desa Umbu Pabal" activePage="layanan">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative h-[400px] flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover" 
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBour6fg3F6hJkfooFWJUPQ0BX81M5yMIyjQdX8LyDg5kqsNQ75tk69GSBy-NxQIPHHdoNYPTZaix0i8ai2bBPfYmDOsSdhBB_cJQBRUc13YjG-cy9u-hleFv6zZbGciEmo7SRzjPkrAyB8WUJTDSwWyXf9yZ-NDOiYtTPUKc0loSS_rTa7WUPZr4KdUpMOatQT-1q0A0JKPWmfMae7Sbp3EE2C9yJlY_eaHwsQ5mF0Z0duf5ymd0axwPVBRPGGhgC08MWY3_15fBc"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/60 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-gutter w-full text-on-primary">
      <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl mb-4 font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl">Layanan Mandiri Masyarakat</h1>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg opacity-90 max-w-2xl">Memudahkan warga dalam mengurus administrasi desa secara online. Cepat, transparan, dan efisien dari genggaman Anda.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Search / Tracking Section -->
  <section class="relative -mt-16 z-20 px-gutter mb-section-padding-desktop">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto animate-fade">
      <div class="bg-surface-bright p-8 rounded-xl shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-outline-variant">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex-1 w-full">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-2 font-bold text-lg">Cek Status Permohonan</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">Masukkan nomor registrasi untuk melacak progres surat Anda.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 w-full flex gap-2">
            <input 
              class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-low border border-outline px-4 py-3 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:border-primary focus:outline-none transition-all" 
              placeholder="Contoh: REG-2024-001" 
              type="text"
              id="tracking-input"
            />
            <button class="bg-secondary text-on-secondary px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">Cek Status</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process Guide -->
  <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-gutter mb-section-padding-desktop">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mb-2 text-2xl font-bold font-headline-lg">Prosedur Pengajuan</h2>
      <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-secondary-container mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 relative">
      <!-- Connectors for desktop -->
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-1/2 left-1/4 right-1/4 h-0.5 bg-outline-variant -z-10"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white">task</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2 text-lg font-bold">1. Pilih Jenis Surat</h4>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">Pilih kategori surat keterangan yang Anda butuhkan dari daftar yang tersedia.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white">edit_document</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2 text-lg font-bold">2. Isi Formulir</h4>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">Lengkapi data diri dan unggah dokumen pendukung yang diperlukan secara digital.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-lg">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white">inventory</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2 text-lg font-bold">3. Ambil di Kantor Desa</h4>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">Setelah status dinyatakan selesai, Anda dapat mengambil fisik surat di kantor desa.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Letter Request Grid (Bento Style Layout) -->
  <section class="bg-surface-container-low py-section-padding-desktop">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div class="mb-12 flex justify-between items-end">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary text-2xl font-bold">Daftar Layanan Surat</h2>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2 font-body-md">Pilih jenis permohonan surat administrasi kependudukan Anda.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
        <!-- Featured: Domisili -->
        <div class="md:col-span-8 bg-surface-bright p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:shadow-[0px_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all group">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 h-full">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container rounded-full text-[12px] font-bold mb-4">Paling Sering</span>
              <h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Surat Keterangan Domisili</h3>
              <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-8 font-body-md">Digunakan untuk keterangan tempat tinggal bagi warga pendatang maupun warga tetap untuk keperluan perbankan, pekerjaan, atau sekolah.</p>
              <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]">check_circle</span> Fotocopy KTP &amp; KK
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]">check_circle</span> Pengantar RT/RW
                </li>
              </ul>
              <button class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 font-bold cursor-pointer">
                Buat Permohonan <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">add_circle</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden md:block w-1/3">
              <img 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" 
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDKN2qQPiylMhFfC3Yx9qnanujCU0RYn9KTfRb1Ayr5YRxCSyxLOnfwrRZ4yupypQJ2vgFTAOMrwroWPX8c-hhXumRtR9MaBEXENlNuC6E5FpI20MOR-jKjfdUSnlzx3n-ziU8a27dGDfIFmT517_9KySHqmF7FGxprbnHGXX517itLMlZa5fjBA2e0yP55kL_mfifz_EGI3ddO62zPMP9d16rBun8Cs7mlABuO4fdFnl46JXSIsQPrD-EKZBpFC8WZCBZ7GBa2nAM"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- SKU -->
        <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-surface-bright p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:shadow-[0px_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-fixed rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">storefront</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-2 font-bold text-lg">Keterangan Usaha</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-6 font-body-md text-sm">Dokumen resmi untuk legalitas usaha mikro/kecil di wilayah desa.</p>
          </div>
          <button class="w-full bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary transition-colors font-bold cursor-pointer">Buat Permohonan</button>
        </div>
        <!-- SKTM -->
        <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-surface-bright p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:shadow-[0px_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-fixed rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">volunteer_activism</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-2 font-bold text-lg">SK Tidak Mampu</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-6 font-body-md text-sm">Layanan khusus untuk pengajuan bantuan sosial atau keringanan biaya.</p>
          </div>
          <button class="w-full bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary transition-colors font-bold cursor-pointer">Buat Permohonan</button>
        </div>
        <!-- Nikah -->
        <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-surface-bright p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:shadow-[0px_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-fixed rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">favorite</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-2 font-bold text-lg">Pengantar Nikah</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-6 font-body-md text-sm">Persyaratan administrasi (NA) untuk pendaftaran di KUA setempat.</p>
          </div>
          <button class="w-full bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant py-3 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary transition-colors font-bold cursor-pointer">Buat Permohonan</button>
        </div>
        <!-- Lainnya -->
        <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-primary text-on-primary p-8 rounded-2xl border border-primary hover:shadow-[0px_10px_30px_rgba(1,45,29,0.2)] transition-all flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center group cursor-pointer">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[48px] mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">more_horiz</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-2 font-bold text-lg text-white">Layanan Lainnya</h3>
          <p class="opacity-80 text-sm">Tidak menemukan surat yang Anda butuhkan? Lihat daftar lengkap layanan kami.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Emergency / CTA -->
  <section class="py-section-padding-desktop">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div class="bg-secondary-container rounded-3xl p-12 overflow-hidden relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-secondary opacity-10 rounded-full -mr-32 -mt-32"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 flex-1">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-secondary-container mb-4 font-bold text-3xl">Butuh Bantuan Mendesak?</h2>
          <p class="text-on-secondary-container/80 text-body-lg mb-8 font-body-lg text-lg">Staf kantor desa siap membantu Anda jika terdapat kendala dalam pengisian formulir online atau butuh konsultasi cepat.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md flex items-center gap-2 hover:opacity-90 transition-all font-bold" href="tel:123456">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">call</span> Hubungi Kantor Desa
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10 w-full md:w-1/3">
          <img 
            class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-xl" 
            src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAf9nhP9NTk7V_tsT05IEB5lXfudm_6ANIcSqg1ME6ZmBU8imSi9t5ZGmc02Q2WGYAnIu1WI7GBsiFs_5w3UWAQ_eVZWzHeSg3xFSp9_OjMmJAw5Ev4HDsiX4p5FwfyhJjXPtseVyMylwqLqC8xGAJ7N1-ePg2qU7fB4cglX4ukd63PZWM23daTO7GgefbCqPz8pJQ1C3xa9vEN0Q5RtUXS0xcuM1K1O-ph8GohDpQj3Zma05ag8l1Rv7aDTTXxEd6iHInt03Wtvh8"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const trackInput = document.getElementById('tracking-input');
      if (trackInput) {
        trackInput.addEventListener('focus', () => {
          trackInput.parentElement.classList.add('scale-[1.02]');
        });
        trackInput.addEventListener('blur', () => {
          trackInput.parentElement.classList.remove('scale-[1.02]');
        });
      }
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
